imx-sdma: expose Glowforge cnc step-stream API

ForgeFIRM motion path. Exposes the channel-0 bootload path,
external-event ownership, priority and a custom per-channel interrupt
callback used by glowforge.ko. The struct/prototype contract lives in
include/linux/platform_data/dma-imx-sdma.h.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]
Signed-off-by: Scott Wiederhold <s.e.wiederhold@gmail.com>

